{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35694","headline":"赠徐三十 · 李山甫","name":"赠徐三十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春满南宫白日长，夜来新值锦衣郎。\n朱排六相助神耸，玉衬一厅侵骨凉。\n砌竹拂袍争草色，庭花飘艳妬兰香。\n从今不羡乘槎客，曾到三星列宿傍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35694.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35694","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}